OL,3,GNEWSAActor Owen Cooper stars in new    
OL,4,ABeatles music video                    
OL,6,FAward-winning actor Owen Cooper has    
OL,7,Fstarred in a new music video for The   
OL,8,FBeatles song In My Life.               
OL,10,FThe video for the newly mixed track,   
OL,11,Ffrom the band's 1965 album Rubber Soul,
OL,12,Fcelebrates their hometown of Liverpool.
OL,14,FThe Warrington-born star appears in the
OL,15,Ffilm, which features Liverpool         
OL,16,Flandmarks including the Royal Liver    
OL,17,FBuilding, Liverpool Cathedral, Royal   
OL,18,FAlbert Dock and Strawberry Field.      
OL,20,FCooper, 16, is best known for his role 
OL,21,Fin Netflix drama Adolescence, for which
OL,22,Fhe won an Emmy Award.                  
